    "political_and_social_context": "Publicly documented: long-running hostility from other German fan groups and legal/regulatory scrutiny of RB's compliance with the DFL 50+1 rule; UEFA multi-club-ownership conditions applied to Red Bull clubs entering the same competition; Jürgen Klopp's role as Red Bull Head of Global Soccer (since 2025) drew public criticism in Germany. No further institution-level controversies verified for 2025/26.",
